&lt;!-- HERO --&gt; &lt;div class="da-main"&gt; &lt;div class="da-bg pc" style="background-image: url('images/pw1.jpg')" &gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="da-bg phone" style="background-image: url('images/pw1-b.jpg')" &gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="da-text"&gt; &lt;div class="da-box"&gt; &lt;div class="da-tip d-bold"&gt;ZWCAD CAD Software&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="da-pill"&gt; &lt;span class="pill-dot"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; ZWCAD now available &lt;/div&gt; &lt;h2 class="da-titles d-bold"&gt; ZWCAD is built for faster DWG CAD workflows &lt;/h2&gt; &lt;div class="da-intro"&gt; Native RVT import, faster block editing, and one-click data extraction for UK design teams. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="da-buttombox"&gt; &lt;a class="da-buttom d-bold" href="https://www.cygnas.co.uk/zwsoft-uk/zwcad-2027/#pricing"&gt;See Pricing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class="da-buttom white d-bold" href="https://www.cygnas.co.uk/zwsoft-uk/assets/zwcad-2027-brochure.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" &gt;Download Brochure&lt;/a &gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;!-- WHAT'S NEW --&gt; &lt;div class="dc-main"&gt; &lt;div class="dc-inner"&gt; &lt;div class="dc-top"&gt; &lt;h2 class="dc-titles d-bold"&gt; ZWCAD – &lt;span class="dc-span d-bold"&gt;More Powerful, More Efficient&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/h2&gt; &lt;div class="dc-synopsis"&gt; ZWCAD takes performance, stability, and functionality to the next level. With enhanced reliability and exciting new features, it's designed to help you work smarter and faster than ever before. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-synopsis2 d-bold"&gt; Discover the key highlights below and see what's new in ZWCAD. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-cont"&gt; &lt;div class="dc-item"&gt; &lt;div class="dc-box"&gt; &lt;video src="assets/ParametricDesign.mp4" x5-playsinline playsinline webkit-playsinline="true" autoplay="autoplay" muted="muted" loop="loop" &gt;&lt;/video&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-text"&gt; &lt;div class="dc-name d-bold"&gt;Parametric Design&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-intro"&gt; Drive geometry with parameters to iterate faster and keep designs consistent across revisions. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-item"&gt; &lt;div class="dc-box"&gt; &lt;img src="assets/Smart%20Match.webp" alt="Smart Match" /&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-text"&gt; &lt;div class="dc-name d-bold"&gt;Smart Match&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-intro"&gt; Instantly match properties between objects to keep drawings tidy without manual tweaks. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-item"&gt; &lt;div class="dc-box"&gt; &lt;img src="assets/Smart%20Dimension.gif" alt="Smart Dimension" /&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-text"&gt; &lt;div class="dc-name d-bold"&gt;Smart Dimension&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-intro"&gt; Add precise dimensions with automatic alignment and spacing, reducing cleanup time. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-item"&gt; &lt;div class="dc-box"&gt; &lt;img src="assets/Similar%20Search.gif" alt="Similar Search" /&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-text"&gt; &lt;div class="dc-name d-bold"&gt;Similar Search&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-intro"&gt; Find and reuse similar components instantly to speed up repetitive drafting tasks. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="dc-bottom"&gt; &lt;a class="dc-link d-bold" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#leadform" data-lead-source="whats_new_order" &gt;Order ZWCAD Now&lt;/a &gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;!-- FEATURES --&gt; &lt;div class="df-main"&gt; &lt;div class="df-inner"&gt; &lt;div class="df-top"&gt; &lt;h2 class="df-titles d-bold"&gt; ZWCAD - our best CAD solution - now even &lt;span class="df-span d-bold"&gt;more powerful&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/h2&gt; &lt;div class="df-synopsis"&gt; ZWCAD elevates your design with innovative features that simplify your workflow, enhance productivity, and provide the precision and flexibility to bring your ideas to life. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-bottom"&gt; &lt;div class="df-dl"&gt; &lt;h2 class="df-dt d-bold"&gt;Top Features&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;div class="df-dd"&gt; &lt;div class="df-list"&gt; &lt;div class="df-item"&gt; &lt;div class="df-box play-box" data-mp4="assets/ParametricDesign.mp4" &gt; &lt;img data-img="images/zc-4.jpg" alt="ZWCAD efficiency improvement preview" class="df-img" /&gt; &lt;div class="df-play"&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-text"&gt; &lt;div class="df-lbs"&gt; &lt;span class="df-lb"&gt;Enhanced&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="df-versions"&gt;V1.2&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-tit d-bold"&gt;Efficiency Improvement&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-des"&gt; Open, pan and zoom complex 3D models faster and smoother. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-item"&gt; &lt;div class="df-box play-box" data-mp4="https://www.youtube.com/embed/kUU9mXejHQc" &gt; &lt;img data-img="images/zc-5.jpg" alt="ZWCAD visual styles preview" class="df-img" /&gt; &lt;div class="df-play"&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-text"&gt; &lt;div class="df-lbs"&gt; &lt;span class="df-lb"&gt;New&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class="df-versions"&gt;V1.2&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-tit d-bold"&gt;New Visual Styles&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-des"&gt; Meet diverse visualization needs with the addition of 4 visualstyles, including Conceptual, Realistic, Shade of Grey, and Xray. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-item"&gt; &lt;div class="df-box play-box" data-mp4="assets/IFC_Import_Edit_Export.mp4"&gt; &lt;img data-img="images/zc-6.jpg" alt="ZWCAD STEP file import preview" class="df-img" /&gt; &lt;div class="df-play"&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-text"&gt; &lt;div class="df-lbs"&gt; &lt;span class="df-lb"&gt;New&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class="df-versions"&gt;V1.2&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-tit d-bold"&gt;STEP File Import&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-des"&gt; Directly import 3D files in STEP formats (AP203 and AP214) without the hassle of format conversion. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-item"&gt; &lt;div class="df-box play-box" data-mp4="assets/ZWCADToolbox.mp4"&gt; &lt;img data-img="images/zc-7.jpg" alt="ZWCAD 3D Gizmo preview" class="df-img" /&gt; &lt;div class="df-play"&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-text"&gt; &lt;div class="df-lbs"&gt;&lt;span class="df-lb"&gt;New&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-tit d-bold"&gt;3D Gizmo&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-des"&gt; Move, rotate, and scale 3D objects conveniently with 3D gizmos. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-item"&gt; &lt;div class="df-box play-box" data-mp4="assets/SmartPlot.mp4"&gt; &lt;img data-img="images/zc-8.jpg" alt="ZWCAD ribbon improvement preview" class="df-img" /&gt; &lt;div class="df-play"&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-text"&gt; &lt;div class="df-lbs"&gt; &lt;span class="df-lb"&gt;Enhanced&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-tit d-bold"&gt;Ribbon Improvement&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-des"&gt; Customize your own workspace freely with Ribbon panels that can be slid out, dragged, floated and collapsed as icons. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-item"&gt; &lt;div class="df-box play-box" data-mp4="assets/SelectMenu.mp4"&gt; &lt;img data-img="images/zc-9.jpg" alt="ZWCAD panel improvement preview" class="df-img" /&gt; &lt;div class="df-play"&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-text"&gt; &lt;div class="df-lbs"&gt; &lt;span class="df-lb"&gt;Enhanced&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-tit d-bold"&gt;Panel Improvement&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-des"&gt; Panels can be stacked and hidden automatically to provide a bigger drawing space. A new navigator helps you drag or dock panels more conveniently. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-item"&gt; &lt;div class="df-box play-box" data-mp4="assets/AddSelect.mp4"&gt; &lt;img data-img="images/zc-10.jpg" alt="ZWCAD floating drawing window preview" class="df-img" /&gt; &lt;div class="df-play"&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-text"&gt; &lt;div class="df-lbs"&gt;&lt;span class="df-lb"&gt;New&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-tit d-bold"&gt;Floating Drawing Window&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-des"&gt; View multiple drawings simultaneously with drawing windows that can be dragged out of the program as floating windows. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-item"&gt; &lt;div class="df-box play-box" data-mp4="assets/SimilarSearch.mp4"&gt; &lt;img data-img="images/zc-11.jpg" alt="ZWCAD point cloud improvement preview" class="df-img" /&gt; &lt;div class="df-play"&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-text"&gt; &lt;div class="df-lbs"&gt; &lt;span class="df-lb"&gt;Enhanced&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-tit d-bold"&gt;Point Cloud Improvement&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-des"&gt; Meet different needs with the addition of 3 visual styles including Intensity, Elevation, and Classification, and the Navigate to Scan View function. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-item"&gt; &lt;div class="df-box play-box" data-mp4="assets/SmartMatch.mp4"&gt; &lt;img data-img="images/zc-12.jpg" alt="ZWCAD GIS improvement preview" class="df-img" /&gt; &lt;div class="df-play"&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-text"&gt; &lt;div class="df-lbs"&gt; &lt;span class="df-lb"&gt;Enhanced&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-tit d-bold"&gt;GIS Improvement&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-des"&gt; It can import more mapping services such as Bing Maps, and match geographic markers with specified points in drawings. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="df-last"&gt; &lt;div class="df-more d-bold"&gt; Show &lt;span class="df-more-txt1 d-bold"&gt;More&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="df-more-txt2 d-bold"&gt;Less&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="df-more-ic